eculating that she's been abducted... But even if she shows herself, we can't really do anything to her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Hit","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Slam! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange kicks the leg of her table furiously, scattering everything onto the floor."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Since the surveillance system was sabotaged at the crime scene, we don't know how the white Nyto managed to kill Leone. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By the time AK-15 found her, she had already committed suicide, so that doesn't lead us anywhere."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In other words, I have no more cards to play, huh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange's fist is clenched nearly tight enough to crush her own phalanges. She stares at the mess lying on the floor with her jaws locked and her mind racing."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leone is dead; Gray is missing; the killer is conveniently out of the picture... All her leads turn into dead ends. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She was hoping she could find out more from Gray, but that woman is more tight-lipped than she thought. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Other than her connection with Morridow, Gray didn't reveal much about herself..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Knife_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"effect","value":"%%code=CJ_zidan%%","raw":"common_effect"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Morridow?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"2020summerOffice","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"NPC-Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange suddenly jumps to her feet."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Light","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Light","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Ange?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"12, get me the Commander! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I need to see Morridow!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No problem~ AK-12 at your service~"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange opens her mouth, but is then at a loss for words."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Contact the Commander, RPK. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We need to talk."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"On it. The line is connected."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hello? Commander? Are you there? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our boss wants to talk to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RPK? Is Ange looking for me?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm currently...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good afternoon, Commander... How are things on your end?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Going well, I guess. We just found a lead.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How about you?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Humph, I'm getting by. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Actually, I have a favor to ask of you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why so formal? Just ask.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow—that Nyto. Is she still with you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"p